From: FrontMage <frontmage@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rpcd_builder: expose full persist/sensors tree

Upstream maps SENSORS_REGISTRY only at /persist/sensors/registry/registry,
hiding /persist/sensors/sensors_list.txt and /persist/sensors/registry/sns_reg_version
that Qualcomm ADSP sensor_pd reads during initialization. Map /persist/sensors
directly to SENSORS_REGISTRY so the full staged tree is visible.
---
 hexagonrpcd/rpcd_builder.c | 6 +-----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hexagonrpcd/rpcd_builder.c b/hexagonrpcd/rpcd_builder.c
index d374958..bc803ec 100644
--- a/hexagonrpcd/rpcd_builder.c
+++ b/hexagonrpcd/rpcd_builder.c
@@ -161,11 +161,7 @@ struct hexagonfs_dirent *construct_root_dir(const char *prefix, const char *dsp)
 	 * a hard link between both locations.
 	 */
 	persist_dir = hfs_mkdir("persist", 1,
-				hfs_mkdir("sensors", 1,
-					hfs_mkdir("registry", 1,
-						hfs_map("registry", sns_reg)
-					)
-				)
+				hfs_map("sensors", sns_reg)
 		      );
 
 	/*
-- 
2.45.0
